{"title":"Katy Perry is fighting with Wendy's about going to space","link":"https://www.garbageday.email/p/katy-perry-is-fighting-with-wendy-s-about-going-to-space","date":1745000027000,"content":"<div><div><p><i>Welcome to Garbage Weekend. It’s the internet garbage you know and love, but in a format that’s easier to read while you try and fail to</i></p><p><span>▲</span><br /><span>▲ ▲</span></p><div><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/ad11d23d-1b4d-458b-932b-808ec68c5b8e/GettyImages-2209682675.jpg?t=1744992054\" /><div><span><p>(Photo by Justin Hamel/Getty Images)</p></span></div></div><p>This week was one big stress test for the alloy of the amoral business leaders, computer-themed doomsday cultists, and spineless career climbers that are theoretically in charge of the US government. <a href=\"https://www.politico.com/news/2025/04/17/an-expert-breaks-down-zuckerbergs-big-week-in-court-00297783?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=katy-perry-is-fighting-with-wendy-s-about-going-to-space\" target=\"_blank\">Meta</a> and <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/technology/us-judge-finds-google-holds-illegal-online-ad-tech-monopolies-2025-04-17/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=katy-perry-is-fighting-with-wendy-s-about-going-to-space\" target=\"_blank\">Google</a> are both facing legal challenges over monopoly, which could get them broken up if they don't win the <a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/us-news/law/mark-zuckerberg-meta-antitrust-ftc-negotiations-a53b3382?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=katy-perry-is-fighting-with-wendy-s-about-going-to-space\" target=\"_blank\">Replace Elon Musk Hunger Games</a>. Speaking of, President Donald Trump's <a href=\"https://www.cbsnews.com/news/howard-lutnick-trump-tariffs-penguins-heard-mcdonald-islands/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=katy-perry-is-fighting-with-wendy-s-about-going-to-space\" target=\"_blank\">definitely not AI-generated</a> tariffs get new <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c20xn626y81o?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=katy-perry-is-fighting-with-wendy-s-about-going-to-space\" target=\"_blank\">exemptions</a> and <a href=\"https://www.reuters.com/technology/apple-shares-lead-tech-higher-after-tariff-exemptions-2025-04-14/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=katy-perry-is-fighting-with-wendy-s-about-going-to-space\" target=\"_blank\">conditions</a> almost every day, in a process that happens to look an awful lot like <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/02/27/technology/personaltech/vibecoding-ai-software-programming.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=katy-perry-is-fighting-with-wendy-s-about-going-to-space\" target=\"_blank\">vibecoding</a>. A human touch is still required for anything important these days. Just ask normal human being Katy Perry, who’s currently <a href=\"https://people.com/katy-perry-deserves-apology-from-wendys-blue-origin-comments-exclusive-source-11717191?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=katy-perry-is-fighting-with-wendy-s-about-going-to-space\" target=\"_blank\">feuding with Wendy's</a> over astronautical stolen valor. It all happens on X, even the vice president <a href=\"http://chpowerup.com/335565/nvidia-geforce-rtx-5060-ti-8-gb-variants-not-made-available-to-review-outlets?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=katy-perry-is-fighting-with-wendy-s-about-going-to-space\" target=\"_blank\">ignoring due process</a>!</p><p>Oh well, here’s some fun stuff…</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/bunbunbillion/780397574954926080?source=share&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=news